WEBVTT

00:02:55.338 --> 00:03:00.509
Well, I happen to be a biologist
on the only planet

00:03:00.551 --> 00:03:03.888
where you can be a biologist
in the entire universe.

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:05.264
(Laughter)

00:03:05.306 --> 00:03:08.309
And that makes my job
very, very special, right?

00:03:10.811 --> 00:03:14.190
Because our planet
offers an incredible opportunity

00:03:14.190 --> 00:03:16.442
to explore its own origins

00:03:16.442 --> 00:03:20.738
and understand how chemistry
converted itself into an agent

00:03:20.738 --> 00:03:23.199
capable of responding to its environment

00:03:23.199 --> 00:03:25.952
and stimulating itself
in response to this.

00:03:26.702 --> 00:03:30.498
In the past 10 years,
there has been remarkable innovations